@* What the page is about and what it is, in the page's head (F121, F123): shown by the browser and read by a search
   engine from the HTML the framework serves. One HeadContent for both, since Blazor keeps only the last one a page
   renders. Each schema is written whole as markup, since a component may not hold a script tag of its own. *@
<HeadContent>
    <meta name="description" content="@Description" />
    @foreach (var script in Scripts)
    {
        @((MarkupString)script)
    }
</HeadContent>
